# Public browser credentials, committed on purpose.
# The anon key is public by design: it ships inside the JS bundle and every table
# is protected by RLS. Never add SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY or PRINT_SIGNING_SECRET here.
#
# Why a committed file instead of wrangler.toml [vars]? Vite inlines VITE_* at BUILD
# time, while [vars] only binds at Functions RUNTIME, so [vars] cannot supply these.
# Keep .env.local gitignored for any real overrides.
